        "abstract": "IFIN-HH and the Faculty of Physics will always be concerned about the modern educational system in nuclear training and beyond. Students often need additional training to acquire knowledge and skills specific to research requirements, especially in the nuclear field. It is essential for students to be able to use the new education and training systems. Within the Nuclear Training Center (CPSDN), the improvement of training programs in the nuclear field takes place permanently. A few years ago, the CPSDN launched a modernization process that includes, besides the modern laboratory for practical training, an e-Learning platform for monitoring the nuclear training process. By developing a modern electronic system, important steps will be taken to computerize and virtualize the learning process.",
